---
/**
 * The site footer, on every tool page.
 *
 * It exists to say who made this, and it carries the only link out to
 * seattlemakers.org now that the masthead is identity and nothing else. A link
 * inside a sentence that explains it beats a bare address floating in a bar.
 *
 * Hidden in print along with the masthead: /labels puts a full-bleed sheet on
 * the page and anything else on it is ink in the wrong place.
 */
---

<footer class="sm-footer no-print">
  <p>
    Built with <span class="sm-heart">❤️</span> by the <a
      href="https://seattlemakers.org"
      rel="noopener">Seattle Makers Community</a
    >
  </p>
</footer>
